:"steam-4740930","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Live | Release Date Announced!","summary":"Hello, Lords!Thank you so much for your continued support and interest in Legend of Defenders!First, I’d like to announce that Legend of Defenders will officially launch on November 2! If you enjoy our game, please add it to your wishlist. We’d also love it if you shared it with your friends. Your wishlists and time spent playing the demo mean so much to us!After several days of playtesting, we’ve also collected a wealth of suggestions and feedback. We’ve carefully read every piece of them. If y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683605","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4740930-1845383656384872","game_id":"steam-4740930","kind":"update","title":"Demo Version Update | Bug Fixes","summary":"After a day of playtesting, we gathered a lot of feedback and bug reports. That's why we've moved quickly to deliver this update.The main contents of this update are as follows:Added two guides, resolving the issue where players couldn't obtain a Captain in time after acquiring the Captain slot, making the flow smoother.Fixed several issues left over from earlier builds where some characters' basic attack range didn't match their description.Resolved an out-of-memory (memory overflow) issue that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T04:09:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4740930-1845383656379493","game_id":"steam-4740930","kind":"announcement","title":"New Heroes, New Features, and a New Boss","summary":"Hello, Lords!Thank you so much for your continued support and interest in Legend of Defenders. We’re thrilled to announce that the Demo is now live!This update brings a ton of new content—we’ve added several new characters and officially opened the Black Market. Unfortunately, due to major data structure changes in this version, Playtest save data cannot be carried over directly to the Demo. This means you’ll need to start your castle defense journey again. We sincerely appreciate your understan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T02:09:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4740930-1843481262701382","game_id":"steam-4740930","kind":"announcement","title":"The Blacksmith Is Now Open!","summary":"Greetings, Castle Lords!Thank you so much for supporting Legend of Defenders and for sharing your feedback and suggestions with us!In the latest Playtest, we’ve added the long-awaited Blacksmith system! You can now enhance and enchant your equipment, as well as reforge its substats, giving you even more ways to strengthen your heroes and defenses.We attach great importance to your gaming experience, and we will continue to closely monitor, actively respond to, and optimize based on your feedback","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:06:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701382","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4740930-1840944183785560","game_id":"steam-4740930","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update | Castle Level Cap Raised to Lv. 150","summary":"Greetings, Castle Lords!Since the store page for \"Legend of Defenders\" went live, we have been truly grateful for all your enthusiastic support, playtesting, and wishlists! We have carefully listened to the valuable feedback you shared across communities and reviews. In response to your requests for \"more content,\" this update significantly increases the Castle Level cap and brings multiple experience enhancements!Update DetailsThe Castle Level cap has been raised from Lv. 70 to Lv. 150, now sup","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T09:55:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785560","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4740930-1840944183778457","game_id":"steam-4740930","kind":"announcement","title":"Play Now and Wishlist!","summary":"Welcome to Legend of Defenders!If you enjoy tower defense, strategic team building, and idle gameplay, add the game to your wishlist! Once the store page is live, Steam will notify you when there’s news, events, or the full release.What’s included in the Playtest?Elemental Heroes & Turrets: Deploy 9 heroes with different roles, 4 turrets with different elemental effects, and 2 cannons. Mix and match them to build your ideal castle defense.Rich Talent Trees & Builds: Choose your progression based","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T03:10:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183778457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4740930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4740930":"2026-10-26T04:01:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4740930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:4